    /// Answers a walk-forward run as it stands: each window's in-sample and out-of-sample stretches, its batch, the figures chosen and their in-sample net, the out-of-sample trades and net, and the efficiency (out-of-sample net a day over in-sample net a day, where the in-sample net is above zero); the out-of-sample total; and once every window settled, where its record was written.
